  "Networked application work covers Java and C# client/server systems, TCP sockets, shared state, WPF interfaces, and server-side catalogue management.": "Werk aan netwerkapplicaties omvat Java- en C#-client/serversystemen, TCP-sockets, gedeelde toestand, WPF-interfaces en server-side catalogusbeheer.",
