  "One coherent platform across device, network, backend, data, observability, and UI": "Eén samenhangend platform voor apparaat, netwerk, backend, data, observability en UI",
  "The project is intended to demonstrate systems thinking rather than isolated technology samples by connecting the complete control and telemetry chain.": "Het project demonstreert systeemdenken in plaats van losse technologievoorbeelden door de volledige besturings- en telemetrieketen te verbinden.",
